{"id":"steam-5531670","steam":5531670,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"PIRACY","summary":"A LITTLE PIRACY ON THE SOLAR SEA.\r\n\r\nSail the winds. Meet the Sirens. Sink the Kings.","about":"Sail a battered ship across a strange Solar Sea. Fight eccentric Pirate Kings, meet sharp-tongued Sirens, upgrade APHELION, and recover records that grow your soundtrack. A stylish naval action-adventure with a laid-back streak.\n\nA LITTLE PIRACY ON THE SOLAR SEA.\nAPHELION has seen better days. She's still fast, though, and there's plenty of sea left to cross.\nSet sail across a strange ring of islands, harbours and dangerous waters. Follow the solar wind, pick your fights, improve your battered ship and see what's waiting beyond the next stretch of open water.\nSAIL YOUR OWN WAY\nNavigate the Solar Sea by wind, explore its ports and islands, and take detours whenever something catches your eye. There's a purpose to the voyage, but no great need to hurry.\nMAKE A LITTLE TROUBLE\nBring your turret and broadsides to bear against rival ships, mines, rammers and the formidable Pirate Kings. Learn each enemy's habits, make the most of your momentum, and keep APHELION afloat long enough to fight another day.\nMEET THE SIRENS\nSeven Sirens inhabit the Ring. They're curious, confident and occasionally rather unimpressed by their Little Captain. Discover their stories, listen to their conversations and find a few good reasons to keep sailing.\nCOLLECT THE MUSIC\nAcross the Solar Sea, curious PHONON record ships broadcast their tunes over the water. Defeat them to recover new grooves and add the songs to your sailing soundtrack.\nKEEP A RECORD OF THE JOURNEY\nDiscover ships, places and people in the Map Room, collect resources and upgrade APHELION in port. The Ring has its share of secrets, odd characters and things best encountered for yourself.\nA little danger, a few new friends, and a rather good cassette collection.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5531670/af3eaf2f72de7efb8d42af15b4805dfa4d463688/library_capsule.jpg?t=1795372029","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5531670/9b83c37df30dd17d2a7bdfdff392be9d958a498b/header.jpg?t=1795372029","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5531670/0a1cc0ef513aa43afa5edea23918603942ae3222/library_hero.jpg?t=1795372029","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5531670/9b83c37df30dd17d2a7bdfdff392be9d958a498b/header.jpg?t=1795372029","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5531670/d3bcfca094349bd191a6227569e2cfa98120da66/page_bg_v6.jpg?t=1795372029","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5531670/38f1f560f38b30206b444746b822640815dfd0d8/ss_38f1f560f38b30206b444746b822640815dfd0d8.600x338.jpg?t=1795372029","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5531670/38f1f560f38b30206b444746b822640815dfd0d8/ss_38f1f560f38b30206b444746b822640815dfd0d8.jpg?t=1795372029"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5531670/ab60044ff747aa0890b3612f8f226bab9afdc81a/ss_ab60044ff747aa0890b3612f8f226bab9afdc81a.600x338.jpg?t=1795372029","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5531670/ab60044ff747aa0890b3612f8f226bab9afdc81a/ss_ab60044ff747aa0890b3612f8f226bab9afdc81a.jpg?t=1795372029"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5531670/762ad75ee901e3615a5077c060837bef9f1e6da1/ss_762ad75ee901e3615a5077c060837bef9f1e6da1.600x338.jpg?t=1795372029","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5531670/762ad75ee901e3615a5077c060837bef9f1e6da1/ss_762ad75ee901e3615a5077c060837bef9f1e6da1.jpg?t=1795372029"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5531670/5181a88424fabdc67ca19fc7550281f